cmake-build*
.idea
CMakeLists.txt.user
build*
scripts/eval/eval_*
scripts/eval_full/eval_*
stats_*.*json
__pycache__

# Calibration debug/cache artifacts (regenerable, large binary caches) --
# keep only the final calibration actually used by the OAK-D live driver.
results/*
!results/calibration_final.json

# Same idea for the AprilGrid-target recalibration work: raw recordings
# (thousands of PNG frames each), regenerated corner/pose caches, and
# per-run console logs are all regenerable from basalt_oak_d_calib_record
# + basalt_calibrate, not source artifacts worth versioning.
calib_recordings/
calib_results/
calib_*.log
calib_results_*.log
